{
    "title": "Music Recognition",
    "description": "Beatfind music recognition is the best way to identify the music around you. It\u00b4s very simple and easy to use.\r\n\r\nWith Beatfind song identifier app you can explore album songs, read artist biographies and discover the top tracks from the identified song artist.\r\n\r\nBeatfind lets you play a music preview of the identified track and give you the option to listen the full song on Spotify, Deezer and Youtube streaming services. Also you can do a web search about the recognized track without writing any word just fast and easy.\r\n\r\nDo you want to tell a friend or family about the amazing song you just discovered? No problem with Beatfind you can share your favorite identified tracks with everyone, share it on twitter, facebook, whatsapp or any other app you want.\r\n\r\nBeatfind not only let you identify songs fast, also allows you to transform any place into a disco club with the flashlight party mode, just press the lightning button and prepare for a flashing strobe light effect in sync with the beats of music.\r\n\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Find a song within seconds (Powered by ACRCloud).\r\n\u2022 Every identified song is saved in the history page.\r\n\u2022 Listen to a preview of the song so you can be sure it matches what you found.\r\n\u2022 Watch music videos on YouTube.\r\n\u2022 Listen to the full song you recognized in Spotify or Deezer.\r\n\u2022 Flashlight party mode in sync with music beats.\r\n\u2022 Hypnotic visualizer.\r\n\u2022 Love the song you've found? Share it with your friends on Facebook, WhatsApp, Twitter and more.\r\n\u2022 Learn more about the album name, release date and tracks.\r\n\u2022 Read the artist biography and know his top songs.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Beatfind music recognition is the best way to identify the music around you. It\u00b4s very simple and easy to use.<br><br>With Beatfind song identifier app you can explore album songs, read artist biographies and discover the top tracks from the identified song artist.<br><br>Beatfind lets you play a music preview of the identified track and give you the option to listen the full song on Spotify, Deezer and Youtube streaming services. Also you can do a web search about the recognized track without writing any word just fast and easy.<br><br>Do you want to tell a friend or family about the amazing song you just discovered? No problem with Beatfind you can share your favorite identified tracks with everyone, share it on twitter, facebook, whatsapp or any other app you want.<br><br>Beatfind not only let you identify songs fast, also allows you to transform any place into a disco club with the flashlight party mode, just press the lightning button and prepare for a flashing strobe light effect in sync with the beats of music.<br><br><b>Features:</b><br>\u2022 Find a song within seconds (Powered by ACRCloud).<br>\u2022 Every identified song is saved in the history page.<br>\u2022 Listen to a preview of the song so you can be sure it matches what you found.<br>\u2022 Watch music videos on YouTube.<br>\u2022 Listen to the full song you recognized in Spotify or Deezer.<br>\u2022 Flashlight party mode in sync with music beats.<br>\u2022 Hypnotic visualizer.<br>\u2022 Love the song you&#39;ve found? Share it with your friends on Facebook, WhatsApp, Twitter and more.<br>\u2022 Learn more about the album name, release date and tracks.<br>\u2022 Read the artist biography and know his top songs.",
